## 3. Apply it, plus the two i18n files

The i18n diffs were exactly the skip strings and nothing else, so those two copy safely:

```bash
cd ~/openvela/apps/examples/velapaw/ui
patch -l -p0 ui_lvgl.c < /tmp/mealskip.patch
cp /tmp/vpbranch/app/velapaw/ui/ui_i18n.c /tmp/vpbranch/app/velapaw/ui/ui_i18n.h .
