```

That last check is the important one: three `malloc` lines must still be present. If they're gone, the wrong thing got applied.

## 4. Clear stale objects and rebuild

Those `.o` files in the source directory are the stale-build trap, so clear them too:

```bash
rm -f ~/openvela/apps/examples/velapaw/ui/*.o \
      ~/openvela/apps/examples/velapaw/ui/ui_lvgl.c.tmp.* \
      ~/openvela/apps/examples/velapaw/.built \
