      ~/openvela/apps/examples/velapaw/Make.dep
cd ~/openvela && ./build.sh esp32s3-devkit:waveshare_lcd -j4 2>&1 | tail -30
```

## 5. Verify the binary before flashing

```bash
grep -ac "skipped" ~/openvela/nuttx/nuttx.bin
```

**Must be 2.** If it says 1, the build didn't take the change — don't flash, send me the build output.

