1	/****************************************************************************
2	 * VelaPaw - interactive LVGL UI (tabbed: Enroll/Recognize/My Pets/Trends)
3	 *
4	 * HARDWARE layout: the real panel is landscape 480x320 (ST7796). The UI fills
5	 * the whole screen: a slim header (breadcrumb + bell) over a 4-tab view whose
6	 * pages scroll vertically when content is taller than the short screen.
7	 *   Enroll    - live camera, capture 5 samples, name + portion, Save Pet
8	 *   Recognize - live recognition, feed the matched pet, cooldown
9	 *   My Pets   - list of enrolled pets (name, portion, fed-today, BCS, sparkline)
10	 *   Trends    - per-pet 7/30-day intake chart
11	 *
12	 * (Originally authored for the 1280x800 emulator as a 600px portrait column;
13	 * re-laid-out for 480x320. All recognition/feeding/store logic is unchanged -
14	 * only geometry and font sizes differ.)
15	 ****************************************************************************/
